{"id": "10th-u6-q118", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "paaichal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "saayavanam_novel_fame", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சா. கந்தசாமியின் முதல் புதினமான \"சாயாவனம்\" எந்த இலக்கிய இதழில் வெளிவந்து அவரைத் தமிழ் இலக்கிய உலகில் புகழின் உச்சிக்குக் கொண்டு சென்றது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மணிக்கொடி", "B": "எழுத்து", "C": "கணையாழி", "D": "தீபம்"}, "explanation": "சி. சு. செல்லப்பாவின் \"எழுத்து\" இதழில் சா. கந்தசாமியின் \"சாயாவனம்\" புதினம் தொடராக வெளிவந்து பெரும் புகழ்பெற்றது; இது நேஷனல் புக் டிரஸ்ட் மூலம் மொழிபெயர்க்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which influential literary journal was Sa. Kandasamy's landmark debut novel \"Saayaavanam\" serialized?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Manikkodi", "B": "Ezhuthu", "C": "Kanaiyaazhi", "D": "Deepam"}, "explanation": "Saayaavanam was published in Ci. Su. Chellappa's pathbreaking magazine \"Ezhuthu\"."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 140, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 14