{"id": "10th-u6-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "agapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match_sirupozhuthu_lands", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐந்திணைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய சிறு பொழுதுகளையும் சரியாகப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) குறிஞ்சி - 1. மாலை\n(b) முல்லை - 2. நண்பகல்\n(c) மருதம் - 3. யாமம்\n(d) நெய்தல் - 4. வைகறை\n(e) பாலை - 5. எற்பாடு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-5, (e)-2", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-2"}, "explanation": "குறிஞ்சி = யாமம் (3); முல்லை = மாலை (1); மருதம் = வைகறை (4); நெய்தல் = எற்பாடு (5); பாலை = நண்பகல் (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 1, 4, 5, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the 5 landscapes with their respective Sirupozhuthu micro-times:\n(a) Kurinji - 1. Maalai\n(b) Mullai - 2. Nanpagal\n(c) Marutham - 3. Yaamam\n(d) Neithal - 4. Vaikarai\n(e) Paalai - 5. Erpaadu", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-5, (e)-2", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-2"}, "explanation": "The correct matching sequence is 3, 1, 4, 5, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source