{"id": "10th-u6-q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "agapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "anbin_ainthinai_count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அகத்திணைகள் மொத்தம் ஏழு வகைப்படும் (கைக்கிளை, ஐந்திணை, பெருந்திணை); அவற்றுள் \"அன்பின் ஐந்திணை\" என அழைக்கப்படுபவை எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மூன்று திணைகள்", "B": "ஐந்து திணைகள் (குறிஞ்சி, முல்லை, மருதம், நெய்தல், பாலை)", "C": "ஏழு திணைகள்", "D": "பன்னிரண்டு திணைகள்"}, "explanation": "தலைவன் தலைவிக்கு இடையே நிகழும் ஒத்த தூய காதலைப் பாடும் குறிஞ்சி, முல்லை, மருதம், நெய்தல், பாலை ஆகிய ஐந்தும் \"அன்பின் ஐந்திணைகள்\" எனப்படுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Out of the seven broad Agatthinais, how many are venerated as \"Anbin Ainthinai\" (The Five Sublime Landscapes of Mutual Love)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Three landscapes", "B": "Five landscapes (Kurinji, Mullai, Marutham, Neithal, Paalai)", "C": "Seven landscapes", "D": "Twelve landscapes"}, "explanation": "The five balanced mutual love landscapes form Anbin Ainthinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_yea