 Unit 6, Page 143", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அகப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "நெய்தல் கருப்பொருள்", "விளரி யாழ் செவ்வழிப் பண்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u6-q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "karupporul_uripporul", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paalai_karupporul_details", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாலை நிலத்திற்குரிய பறவை, பறை மற்றும் தொழில் முறையே எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மயில், தொண்டகம், தேனெடுத்தல்", "B": "புறா/பருந்து, துடி (பறை), வழிப்பறி மற்றும் நிரைகவர்தல் (ஆநிரை கவர்தல்)", "C": "கடற்காகம், மீன்கோட்பறை, மீன்பிடித்தல்", "D": "அன்னம், மணமுழவு, உழவு தொழில்"}, "explanation": "பாலை நிலத்திற்குரிய பறவை = புறா, பருந்து; பறை = துடி; தொழில் = வழிப்பறி, ஆநிரை கவர்தல்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the avifauna, drum, and pursuits associated with the Paalai desert terrain?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Peacock, Thondagam, Honey foraging", "B": "Dove/Eagle (Parunthu), Thudi drum, Highway ambush and cattle rustling", "C": "Seagull, Meenkotparai, Fishing", "D": "Swan, Manamuzhavu, Ploughing"}, "explanation": "Paalai features the eagle, Thudi drum, and highway ambushes."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 143, "cha